  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We first find the points of intersection of the curves&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>which gives, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math>&nbsp;(or) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>12</mn></msqrt></math> (or) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>The graphs of the two curves are shown in figure</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0095_40ce40d72c9a.png\" style=\"width: 442px; height: 230px;\" /></p><p>We have to find the area of the shaded region.</p><p>Required area&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp; (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo></math>&nbsp;The areas&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;are symmetrical about&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo></math>&nbsp;axis )</p><p>where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></munderover><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></munderover><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></msubsup></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>12</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mn>3</mn></munderover><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>12</mn></msqrt></munderover><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>12</mn></msqrt></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>12</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>12</mn></msqrt></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>12</mn><msqrt><mn>12</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>12</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>36</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>12</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>Hence, required area&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>12</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>72</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><msqrt><mn>12</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><msqrt><mn>12</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>72</mn></math></p>"
  }
